@database.transaction

Purpose:
  Unit of work with ACID guarantees.

UseWhen:
  - multiple operations must succeed or fail together
  - data consistency is critical
  - financial or critical business operations

AvoidWhen:
  - read-only operations
  - eventual consistency is acceptable

Why:
  Maintains data integrity across operations.

Related:
  @database.locking
  @patterns.repository

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.core-banking

State: +
